The twelve SVG files in this directory are the chess piece set drawn by
Colin M.L. Burnett (Cburnett on Wikimedia Commons), in the compact form
that Lichess ships (https://github.com/lichess-org/lila, public/piece/cburnett).
The originals are on Wikimedia Commons, for example
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chess_klt45.svg.

The author published them under four licences to choose from: the GNU Free
Documentation License 1.2 or later, Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
3.0, the BSD licence, and the GNU General Public License 2 or later. This
project uses them under the BSD 3-Clause license, which follows.

